| Operation   | Select | Example                | Expected Result |
| ----------- | ------ | ---------------------- | --------------- |
| Addition    | `000`  | `25 + 10`              | `35`            |
| Subtraction | `001`  | `25 - 10`              | `15`            |
| AND         | `010`  | `10101010 & 11001100`  | `10001000`      |
| OR          | `011`  | `10101010 \| 11001100` | `11101110`      |
| XOR         | `100`  | `10101010 ^ 11001100`  | `01100110`      |
| NOT A       | `101`  | `~10101010`            | `01010101`      |
| Increment A | `110`  | `25 + 1`               | `26`            |
| Decrement A | `111`  | `25 - 1`               | `24`            |
